  "details": "I've been having an issue in VRChat for a while where, while I'm playing with friends or other people, their microphones will randomly cut out even though they don't appear to be lagging. The same thing happens to me sometimes, where my microphone cuts out or other players hear me cutting in and out.\n\nI've also noticed that players will randomly appear to lag or freeze even when they aren't actually experiencing lag on their end. This makes it difficult to have conversations and play normally.\n\nI've already tried clearing my VRChat cache to see if that would fix the issue, but it didn't help.\n\n(This doesn't happen in any other games only VRCHAT.)\n\nSteps I've tried:\n\nClearing my cache\n\nRestarting my game\n\nRejoining instances\n\nBehavior:\n\nPlayers' microphones randomly cut out, including mine, and players sometimes appear to lag or freeze despite not actually lagging.\n\nThis has been happening consistently for a while, and I'd appreciate any help figuring out what could be causing it.",
